persons:
    person-myrtle-spearwife:
        properties:
            gender: female
            name:
                value: Myrtle
        notes: One of six spearwives accompanying Mance Rayder (as Abel) to Winterfell. Described as gaunt and grey-haired. She accompanies Rowan and Willow back to the Great Hall during the escape attempt to find Abel. (ADWD, 'Theon')
